          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Art of Fighting 3: The Path of The Warrior",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In this third and final entry in the Art of Fighting series, the story shifts from Ryo Sakazaki to his best friend and rival, Robert Garcia, as he ventures into Mexico to try and locate Freia Lawrence, a childhood friend, who asked for his help. However, he leaves without the consent of The Garcia Foundation, which sends an agent named Karman Cole to get him back. But not everything is as simple as it looks... because Robert is not the only one looking for Freia.\n\nArt of Fighting 3: The Path of The Warrior features ten playable characters with different fighting styles, a completely new fighting system based on joystick and button combinations, and incredibly detailed graphics and animation.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "En esta tercera y última entrega de la serie Art of Fighting, la historia pasa de Ryo Sakazaki a su mejor amigo y rival, Robert Garcia, quien viaja a México para intentar localizar a Freia Lawrence, una amiga de la infancia que le pidió ayuda. Sin embargo, se marcha sin el consentimiento de la Fundación Garcia, que envía a un agente llamado Karman Cole para hacerlo regresar. Pero no todo es tan simple como parece... porque Robert no es el único que busca a Freia.\n\nArt of Fighting 3: The Path of The Warrior cuenta con diez personajes jugables con estilos de combate diferentes, un sistema de combate completamente nuevo basado en combinaciones de joystick y botones, y gráficos y animaciones muy detallados.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1996",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
